{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23173","headline":"喜敏中及第偶示所怀 · 白居易","name":"喜敏中及第偶示所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自知羣从爲儒少，岂料词场中第频。\n桂折一枝先许我，杨穿三叶尽惊人。\n转於文墨须留意，贵向烟霄早致身。\n莫学尔兄年五十，蹉跎始得掌丝纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}